msgstr "Anar a la casella següent o anterior que et necessita"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "`[` and `]`"
msgstr "`[` i `]`"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Go to the previous or the next page"
msgstr "Anar a la pàgina anterior o següent"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "`f`"
msgstr "`f`"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Show every box, only those that need you, or only your own values"
msgstr ""
"Mostrar totes les caselles, només les que et necessiten o només els teus "
"propis valors"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "`d`"
msgstr "`d`"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Show each box on one line or on two"
msgstr "Mostrar cada casella en una línia o en dues"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "`s`"
msgstr "`s`"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:111
msgid "See where the values come from"
msgstr "Veure d'on surten els valors"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "`x` or Delete"
msgstr "`x` o Supr"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Clear a value you entered"
msgstr "Buidar un valor que vas introduir"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "`u`"
msgstr "`u`"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Undo the change you made to the box"
msgstr "Desfer el canvi que vas fer a la casella"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "`R`"
msgstr "`R`"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Review your changes"
msgstr "Revisar els teus canvis"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "F8"
msgstr "F8"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Run the next step"
msgstr "Executar el pas següent"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "`c`"
msgstr "`c`"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Calculate"
msgstr "Calcular"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "`e`"
msgstr "`e`"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Export"
msgstr "Exportar"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "`?` or F1"
msgstr "`?` o F1"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Enlarge the help and list every key"
msgstr "Ampliar l'ajuda i llistar totes les tecles"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Esc"
msgstr "Esc"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Go back"
msgstr "Tornar"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "F3"
msgstr "F3"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Switch between the light and the dark appearance"
msgstr "Canviar entre l'aparença clara i la fosca"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:86
msgid "The footer shows as many keys as fit the width of the terminal."
msgstr "El peu mostra tantes tecles com hi caben a l'amplada del terminal."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:88
msgid "Fill in boxes"
msgstr "Emplenar caselles"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:90
msgid "Move to a box with the arrow keys or with `n`, then press Enter."
msgstr "Ves a una casella amb les fletxes o amb `n` i prem Retorn."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:91
msgid ""
"Type the value the way you write numbers in your language, for example "
"`1.234,56` in Spanish or `1,234.56` in English. The editor shows how it "
"will read the value, or says why it cannot read it."
msgstr ""
"Escriu el valor com escrius els nombres en la teva llengua, per exemple "
"`1.234,56` en català o `1,234.56` en anglès. L'editor mostra com llegirà "
"el valor, o diu per què no el pot llegir."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:94
msgid "Choose **Add to changes**. The box shows Δ with the value it replaces."
msgstr ""
"Tria **Afegeix als canvis**. La casella mostra Δ amb el valor que "
"substitueix."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:96
msgid ""
"Nothing is saved yet. When a box cannot be typed into, the help band says"
" why: a value that follows your records, for example, is corrected in the"
" ledger and then recalculated."
msgstr ""
"Encara no es desa res. Quan en una casella no s'hi pot escriure, la banda"
" d'ajuda diu per què: un valor que segueix els teus registres, per "
"exemple, es corregeix al llibre registre i després es recalcula."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:100
msgid "Review and apply your changes"
msgstr "Revisar i aplicar els teus canvis"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:102
msgid ""
"Press `R`. The review lists each change with its box, how it read before,"
" how it will read after, and what the change does. It warns you when your"
" value replaces an imported or a calculated one: your value keeps winning"
" until you restore the source."
msgstr ""
"Prem `R`. La revisió llista cada canvi amb la seva casella, com era "
"abans, com quedarà després i què fa el canvi. T'avisa quan el teu valor "
"substitueix un d'importat o de calculat: el teu valor mana fins que "
"restauris l'origen."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:107
msgid ""
"Choose **Apply and recalculate** to save the changes and recalculate the "
"declaration, or **Discard all** to drop them. If you leave the workbench "
"with changes you have not applied, it asks you first."
msgstr ""
"Tria **Aplica i recalcula** per desar els canvis i recalcular la "
"declaració, o **Descarta-ho tot** per rebutjar-los. Si surts del banc de "
"treball amb canvis sense aplicar, primer et pregunta."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:113
msgid ""
"Press `s` on any box. The sources view groups every source by family: "
"your records, the registers you keep, your profile, earlier filings, the "
"AEAT draft, the values you enter and the values the official design "
"fixes. Each source says what you can do about its values and whether it "
"has produced data, and lists the boxes it feeds."
msgstr ""
"Prem `s` a qualsevol casella. La vista d'orígens agrupa cada origen per "
"família: la teva comptabilitat, els registres que portes, el teu perfil, "
"les declaracions anteriors, l'esborrany de l'AEAT, els valors que "
"introdueixes tu i els valors que fixa el disseny oficial. Cada origen diu"
" què pots fer amb els seus valors i si ha aportat dades, i llista les "
"caselles que alimenta."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:119
msgid ""
"Press Enter to go to a box, or `o` to open the area that owns the source,"
" such as the ledger or your profile."
msgstr ""
"Prem Retorn per anar a una casella, o `o` per obrir l'apartat al qual "
"pertany l'origen, com el llibre registre o el teu perfil."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:122
msgid "Calculate, verify, file and export"
msgstr "Calcular, verificar, presentar i exportar"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:124
msgid ""
"Press F8 to run the step the journey line offers, or `c` to recalculate "
"at any time once your changes are applied. The values you entered are "
"kept."
msgstr ""
"Prem F8 per executar el pas que ofereix la línia del recorregut, o `c` "
"per recalcular en qualsevol moment quan els teus canvis estiguin "
"aplicats. Els valors que vas introduir es conserven."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:126
msgid ""
"The first Modelo 303 calculation asks the filing answers its period "
"needs: whether you file a joint return and, in the last period of the "
"year, whether you are exempt from Modelo 390."
msgstr ""
"El primer càlcul del Model 303 demana les respostes que necessita el seu "
"període: si presentes una declaració conjunta i, en l'últim període de "
"l'any, si estàs exempt del Model 390."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:129
msgid ""
"Verification checks the declaration. A box that stops you from filing "
"shows ▲, and the navigator counts it on its section."
msgstr ""
"La verificació comprova la declaració. Una casella que t'impedeix "
"presentar mostra ▲, i el navegador la compta al seu apartat."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:131
msgid "Filing asks you to confirm, then records the filing in Cadrumo."
msgstr ""
"La presentació et demana confirmació i després registra la presentació a "
"Cadrumo."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:132
msgid ""
"Once the declaration is verified, `e` exports it: choose where to save "
"it, which file to write and, for Modelo 303, the refund, payment and "
"direct debit choices. The export result then states what the file is "
"worth."
msgstr ""
"Quan la declaració està verificada, `e` l'exporta: tria on desar-la, quin"
" fitxer escriure i, per al Model 303, les opcions de devolució, pagament "
"i domiciliació. Després, el resultat de l'exportació indica el que val el"
" fitxer."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:136
msgid "When something looks unexpected"
msgstr "Quan alguna cosa no és l'esperada"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:138
msgid ""
"**Default, please confirm.** For a declaration calculated outside the "
"workbench, Cadrumo cannot tell which values you typed. Enter the value to"
" confirm it."
msgstr ""
"**Per defecte, confirma-la.** En una declaració calculada fora del banc "
"de treball, Cadrumo no pot saber quins valors vas escriure. Introdueix el"
" valor per confirmar-lo."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:141
msgid ""
"**fixed.** The official design prints the value of the box; you cannot "
"change it."
msgstr ""
"**fixat.** El disseny oficial imprimeix el valor de la casella; no el "
"pots canviar."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:143
msgid ""
"**pages arranged automatically.** The pages were arranged from the "
"official design by Cadrumo and have not been reviewed by hand. Every box "
"still appears exactly once."
msgstr ""
"**pàgines ordenades automàticament.** Cadrumo va ordenar les pàgines a "
"partir del disseny oficial i no s'han revisat a mà. Cada casella continua"
" apareixent exactament una vegada."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:146
msgid ""
"A declaration whose modelo has no arrangement opens with every box in box"
" number order, for viewing only."
msgstr ""
"Una declaració el model de la qual no té distribució s'obre amb totes les"
" caselles per ordre de número, només per a consulta."

